    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113399" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρῐτήσιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thank-offering,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλᾶς χ. ἄγρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antip.Sid.
				</span></i>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				662.53
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				8.464
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Egypt</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spell for winning</i>
			
			<i>favour,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Par.
				1.2227
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Leid.W.</u>
				8.28
			</span></i>(both pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Osl.</u>
				1.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cyran.
				121
			</span></i>, <u>Gloss.</u>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χαρῐτήσια</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά,
				<i>feast of the Charites,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				7.3195.2
			</span></i> (Orchom.
				Boeot.
			, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰρ-είσια</span></b> 
			lapis). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερὸν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
				</span></i>
			 temple <i>of the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χάριτες,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				2.353.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
